Description: The package takes full pedigre strings of set of lines as an input and 
              generates a three column pedigree (line, parent1, parent2) as an output.
              This output is manually curated and the cuated file actsasan input and used to 
              create an additive relationsip matrix. This A matrix and externaly supplied G matrix (Genomic relatedness) is used to 
              crete H matrix. both A and G matrices are comapred for their statisticla similarities.
